Observation
🇺🇸 USA dominates the ecosystem with frameworks for LLMs, multi-agent systems, deep learning, and AI infrastructure.
🇨🇳 China has rapidly expanded in LLM, Agentic AI, and distributed AI training frameworks.
🇯🇵 Japan pioneered influential deep learning frameworks such as Chainer and NNabla and continues to contribute language-model tooling.
🇮🇳 India is emerging with frameworks and SDKs focused on Indic languages and multilingual AI.
Most globally adopted frameworks are open source, enabling developers worldwide to build AI applications without licensing costs.

